### Create an assignment
POST http://localhost:3000/assignments
Content-Type: application/json

< ./fizzbuzz-assignment.json

### Submit a solution
POST http://localhost:3000/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": "ana",
  "code": "function fizz(n) { return n % 3 === 0 ? 'Fizz' : String(n); }"
}

### Student's history
GET http://localhost:3000/assignments/1/submissions?studentId=ana

### Stats for the instructor dashboard
GET http://localhost:3000/assignments/1/stats
